Omong-omong, Pak.

781
01:02:28,286 --> 01:02:30,455
Aku selalu memikirkan cara membantu

782
01:02:30,538 --> 01:02:32,248
Kegubernuran Jenderal.

783
01:02:32,331 --> 01:02:33,875
