Ya, tapi setelah Sato kubunuh,

863
01:10:10,122 --> 01:10:11,916
apa pun ucapannya tak penting.

864
01:10:12,625 --> 01:10:14,293
{\an8}Aku tembak Sato saat dia masuk.

865
01:10:14,376 --> 01:10:16,337
